    "intro_narrative": "You are an elite cyber-operative infiltrated into the clandestine underground server farm of the shadowy 'Apex Syndicate'. The facility has just entered an emergency lockdown, alarms blaring as the central servers begin purging critical evidence of their global operations. Your primary objective is to bypass their multi-layered cryptographic defenses and extract the syndicate's master ledger before it's permanently erased. Time is ticking, and the syndicate's heavily armed enforcers are already sweeping the upper floors, closing in on your position. The room is filled with the hum of high-end servers, glowing monitors, and sophisticated lock mechanisms. You must navigate their intricate digital and physical systems, decode intercepted files, and manipulate their heavily guarded algorithms. Keep your wits about you, trace the data flow through their secure modules, and unlock the main terminal before the data—and your only way out—is lost forever.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
